:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Daily
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrine or _shrine.stage lt 3 or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are no longer in the shrine courtyard.' '你已经不在神社庭院了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_shrineSafe>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot continue the visit now.' '你现在没法继续这次拜访。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<switch _shrine.action>>
  <<case 'prayer' 'donate'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if _shrine.action is 'donate'>>You slip a few coins into the offering box before sitting down.<<else>>You sit beside the offering box, smoothing a corner of the cushion.<</if>>
        Someone has tied a small wooden wish plaque to the railing. Its writing has faded beyond reading.
        <br><br>
        You keep your own wish to yourself. <<if Weather.isFrozen('lake')>>A breeze stirs the bare branches beyond the gate.<<else>>Water knocks softly against the basin.<</if>> For a while, you just listen.
        <<if $fallenangel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.fallenAngel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>The weight at your back settles as you lower your shoulders.<<elseif $angel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.angel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>Your feathers shift when a breeze reaches the veranda.<<elseif $demon gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.demon?.tail ?? 'disabled')>>You find room for your tail beside the cushion.<</if>>
        <br><br>
        You stay a little longer, then stand when you are ready.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if _shrine.action is 'donate'>>你把几枚硬币投入奉纳箱，才坐下来。<<else>>你在奉纳箱旁坐下，轻轻抚平坐垫的一角。<</if>>
        栏杆上系着一块小小的绘马，字迹已经褪得认不清了。
        <br><br>
        你把自己的心愿留在心里。<<if Weather.isFrozen('lake')>>门外光秃的枝条被风吹得轻轻晃动。<<else>>水轻轻碰着石盆。<</if>>有一阵子，你只听着周围的声音。
        <<if $fallenangel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.fallenAngel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>你松下肩膀，背后的重量也渐渐安稳。<<elseif $angel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.angel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>微风吹到廊下，你的羽毛轻轻动了动。<<elseif $demon gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.demon?.tail ?? 'disabled')>>你在坐垫旁给尾巴留出了位置。<</if>>
        <br><br>
        你又坐了一会儿，等心绪平静下来才起身。
    <</language>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
    <<if _shrine.donations gte 2500>>
      <br><br><<lanSwitch 'The new cushion makes it easier to settle. Your offerings have helped make this a comfortable place to return to.' '新换的坐垫坐着很舒服。你留下的奉纳，让这里成了一个更适合歇脚的地方。'>><<lstress>>
    <</if>>
  <<case 'rest'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You settle beside the pond.
        <<if Weather.isFrozen('lake')>>Ice covers the water, with a few leaves caught beneath its cloudy surface.<<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Drops scatter ripples over the surface.<<elseif Weather.isSnow>>Snow rests on the banks; the water between them is dark.<<else>>The overflow runs between two roots and disappears downhill.<</if>>
        <br><br>
        A raven lands a few paces away. <<if Weather.isFrozen('lake')>>It taps the ice once, then turns to look at you.<<else>>It waits until you stop watching, then takes a drink.<</if>> You rest your feet until it flies off.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你在池边坐下。
        <<if Weather.isFrozen('lake')>>冰封住了池面，几片叶子冻在浑浊的冰层里。<<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨滴在水面上打出一圈圈涟漪。<<elseif Weather.isSnow>>岸边积着雪，中间的池水一片深暗。<<else>>溢出的水从两条树根之间流过，往山下去了。<</if>>
        <br><br>
        一只渡鸦落在几步之外。<<if Weather.isFrozen('lake')>>它在冰上啄了一下，转过头来看你。<<else>>等你不再盯着它看，它才低头饮水。<</if>>你歇着脚，直到它飞走。
    <</language>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
    <<if _shrine.donations gte 5000>>
      <br><br><<lanSwitch 'You stretch your legs from the new bench beneath the little shelter. You can rest your legs without balancing on the stone edge.' '你在小雨棚下的新凳子上伸了伸腿。坐稳后，肩背也慢慢松了下来。'>><<ltiredness>>
    <</if>>
  <<default>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You linger in the courtyard for a moment.' '你在庭院里停留片刻。'>>
<</switch>><br><br>
<<deadwood-raven-shrine-return `_shrine.action is 'rest' ? 'pond' : 'courtyard'`>>
